    "intro": {
      "zh": "Sony Walkman TPS-L2 是 1979 年索尼发布的首台随身听，用一盒卡式磁带和一副耳机，把音乐从客厅的音响旁解放到街头、地铁与运动场。它开创了「个人便携音乐」的全新品类，是随身听文化的起点，也是家电影音厅「音乐上街头」叙事的主角。",
      "en": "The Sony Walkman TPS-L2, released in 1979, was the first portable cassette player, using a cassette and a pair of headphones to free music from the living room stereo and take it onto the street, the subway and the running track. It created the personal portable music category and remains the origin of Walkman culture."
    },
    "era": 1979,
    "manufacturer": "Sony"
  },
